{"beat": 14, "name": "THE VATS", "text": "Here's another. During the war, a German iron toy that sold for a dime was cut off. An American maker was asked to make it, and said he couldn't do it at the price. The Woolworth buyer looked at how it was made and said this: You can't afford to use brushes. Throw the toys in vats. Dip them. Then you can leave off this little red stripe and this little yellow stripe. The price stayed. The product changed to fit it. When the war shut out a European crochet cotton, the buyers coached an American spinner to make one like it, sold as Woolco, still at a dime a ball. A trade magazine summed up the method in 1930: A large quantity order and an improved production system has brought hundreds of higher-priced articles down to ten cents.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "Here's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.28}, {"word": "another.", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.56}, {"word": "During", "start": 1.18, "end": 1.4}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.58}, {"word": "war,", "start": 1.58, "end": 1.88}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.04, "end": 2.12}, {"word": "German", "start": 2.12, "end": 2.46}, {"word": "iron", "start": 2.46, "end": 2.94}, {"word": "toy", "start": 2.94, "end": 3.36}, {"word": "that", "start": 3.36, "end": 3.6}, {"word": "sold", "start": 3.6, "end": 3.94}, {"word": "for", "start": 3.94, "end": 4.18}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.34}, {"word": "dime", "start": 4.34, "end": 4.6}, {"word": "was", "start": 4.6, "end": 4.84}, {"word": "cut", "start": 4.84, "end": 5.12}, {"word": "off.", "start": 5.12, "end": 5.42}, {"word": "An", "start": 5.88, "end": 6.02}, {"word": "American", "start": 6.02, "end": 6.38}, {"word": "maker", "start": 6.38, "end": 6.82}, {"word": "was", "start": 6.82, "end": 7.08}, {"word": "asked", "start": 7.08, "end": 7.36}, {"word": "to", "start": 7.36, "end": 7.56}, {"word": "make", "start": 7.56, "end": 7.74}, {"word": "it,", "start": 7.74, "end": 7.94}, {"word": "and", "start": 7.94, "end": 8